    "title": "Hooters calendar girl and supercar influencer killed in McLaren fireball crash",
    "text": "Alexis ‘Lexi’ Kramer died in the fireball crash Picture: lexikinda/Instagram) A young Hooters model has been named as the second victim of a fireball crash after a supercar ploughed into a tree. Alexis ‘Lexi’ Kramer,22,was killed alongside car influencer James Wehr,27,when the supercar they were riding in burst into flames. Lexi stated chatting to Wehr over Instagram for a month before they met for their first date. They had breakfast together and ‘She loved the car community,so it’s such a tragedy that that’s what ended her,’ her sister Gracie Kramer told the New York Post. ‘As you can imagine,this was very shocking and hard. She was kind and funny and charismatic and I’ve had so many people reach out and share their wonderful experiences with Lexi.’",
